**Summary Table:**
| Method | Strategy | Outcome |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Naive** | Last Write Wins | Data Loss |
| **Version Vectors** | Track increments per node | Accurate merge |
| **CRDTs** | Automatic conflict resolution | Consistency |